# Smoke tier: one residual-zero gate fixture per codec backend family, to
# exercise the sid-only BACC parse -> train -> report path end to end.
#
# Entry format: ``<C64Music-relative .sid path><TAB><1-based subtune>``.
# Resolved against the HVSC root (run.py --src-root, default
# /scratch/preframr/hvsc/C64Music) and recovered sid-only via the codec.
# These are the codec's own gate tunes (kept in sync with select.SMOKE_FIXTURES);
# re-curation is a deliberate, commit-logged event.
MUSICIANS/H/Hubbard_Rob/Monty_on_the_Run.sid	1	# hubbard
MUSICIANS/H/Hubbard_Rob/5_Title_Tunes.sid	2	# hubbard (5TT)
MUSICIANS/J/Jammer/Grid_Runner.sid	1	# goattracker
MUSICIANS/L/Lft/A_Mind_Is_Born.sid	1	# lft
MUSICIANS/A/Ass_It/Ode_to_Music.sid	1	# dmc
